{"name": "Gridpaper", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b50832e1387a5a688f35dff831520ea0.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b50832e1387a5a688f35dff831520ea0.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b50832e1387a5a688f35dff831520ea0.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHOOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every shot is a decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Miss, and you'll feel it immediately. Hit a headshot, and you're rewarded with informatica... the currency that makes you faster and more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The more you can make each bullet count, the more you will be rewarded.<br/></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/377e352c88015c6816299fa76ae754a3.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/377e352c88015c6816299fa76ae754a3.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/377e352c88015c6816299fa76ae754a3.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SMASH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A wrench is not a backup weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crush enemies into informatic dust, launch yourself through combat, and turn close-range encounters into opportunities instead of mistakes.<br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f7716897e1a7c3c89357310c2ae3d3c4.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f7716897e1a7c3c89357310c2ae3d3c4.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f7716897e1a7c3c89357310c2ae3d3c4.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SLAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gravity is just another weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drive yourself into the ground and release devastating shockwaves that clear entire groups of enemies in an instant.<br/> <br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/4a6681cec547533a31ba7daca6d15706.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/4a6681cec547533a31ba7daca6d15706.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/4a6681cec547533a31ba7daca6d15706.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHIELD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why dodge a projectile when you can own it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deflect incoming attacks, deny enemy fire, and turn their aggression back against them with perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The safest place on the battlefield is often directly inside the chaos. <br/></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/ac3cbbadd7c401cef7afa317fcbc8aa9.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/ac3cbbadd7c401cef7afa317fcbc8aa9.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/ac3cbbadd7c401cef7afa317fcbc8aa9.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SPEED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game has bunny hopping... and... it can get kind of crazy.<br/> <br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/453969d322ad6983950ba53193b78ee8.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/453969d322ad6983950ba53193b78ee8.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/453969d322ad6983950ba53193b78ee8.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SLIDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every surface is an opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive beneath enemy fire, reposition instantly, and maintain momentum while threading through narrow spaces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...or do just do it to look cool.<br/></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/cc33ab663c62ff26b8f93b3b0ad2a78d.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/cc33ab663c62ff26b8f93b3b0ad2a78d.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/cc33ab663c62ff26b8f93b3b0ad2a78d.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SPRINT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There is no speed limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Accelerate beyond reason, race through handcrafted levels, and compete against players from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Someone already has the record. Take it from them. (It's probably Geetar, tbh)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f37ec9c7b8ebb0c610c5cf9b26be9fbb.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f37ec9c7b8ebb0c610c5cf9b26be9fbb.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/f37ec9c7b8ebb0c610c5cf9b26be9fbb.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SCULPT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build the Geometer you wish you were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mix hardware and software upgrades across every limb, discover powerful combinations, and create a play-style that is entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b997a055dfcc4c0d23b9ba329067b272.poster.avif?t=1785199115\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b997a055dfcc4c0d23b9ba329067b272.webm?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/extras/b997a055dfcc4c0d23b9ba329067b272.mp4?t=1785199115\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SOAR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Soar to the top of the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Compete for world records, climb global rankings, and earn recognition reserved for the fastest players alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I send merch to the top players each month. &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Precision-Driven Gunplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Momentum-Based Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Airborne Combat System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Devastating Ground Slams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Projectile Blocking &amp; Deflection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Skill-Based Melee Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Sprinting, Sliding &amp; Bunny Hopping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Global Leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Community Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Deep Upgrade Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Hardware &amp; Software Augments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Multiple Playstyle Builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Numerous Official Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Map Editor &amp; Community Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Speedrun-Oriented Level Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Replayable Mission Structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Abstract Mathematical World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Diverse Enemy Roster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Real, Tangible Prizes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Ongoing Community-Driven Development</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "If you're shooting more than once, you're doing it wrong. At the junction of the physical and informatic realms, Gridpaper is a high-precision FPS headshot speedrunning game where missed shots are punished. Destroy brains, harvest their Informatica for speed, and climb the global leaderboard.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820870/6bf36bc6a36406b5746c763fe31928d1046373fa/header.jpg?t=1785199115", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "FPS", "Boomer Shooter", "On-Rails Shooter", "Precision Platformer", "3D Platformer"], "developers": "fouriersoft", "publishers": "fouriersoft", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3820870", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0KEYmikLwKs", "first_seen": 1777161600.0, "review_rank": 771}